{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20274","headline":"永嘉行 · 张籍","name":"永嘉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄头鲜卑入洛阳，胡儿执戟升明堂。\n晋家天子作降虏，公卿奔走如牛羊。\n紫陌旌幡暗相触，家家鸡犬惊上屋。\n妇人出门随乱兵，夫死眼前不敢哭。\n九州诸侯自顾土，无人领兵来护主。\n北人避胡多在南，南人至今能晋语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"李坤栋"}